flowchart TD
  Sale[Sale completed] --> Validate[Validate items, tax, tenders, permissions]
  Validate --> Stock[Post stock issue / COGS]
  Validate --> Payment[Allocate tenders / receivable]
  Validate --> Revenue[Revenue and tax calculation]
  Stock --> Journal[Balanced journal via posting service]
  Payment --> Journal
  Revenue --> Journal
  Journal --> Audit[Source links + audit + outbox]
  Audit --> Reports[Financial and operational projections]
